title: Remove `pallet-election-provider-multi-phase`
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Removes `pallet-election-provider-multi-phase` and its e2e test crate, in favor of `pallet-election-provider-multi-block` with `pallet-staking-async`.

    A runtime that uses the pallet must remove it and clear its storage, for example with `frame_support::migrations::RemovePallet`. Then it can move to `pallet-staking-async` with `pallet-election-provider-multi-block`, or keep `pallet-staking` and set `ElectionProvider` to `onchain::OnChainExecution` or `NoElection`.

    Users of the `polkadot-sdk` umbrella crate must remove the `pallet-election-provider-multi-phase` feature.
crates:
- name: polkadot-sdk
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-runtime-common
  bump: major
- name: pallet-election-provider-multi-block
  bump: none
